{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":881246,\"title\":\"Blending Christmas\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The holiday season is in full swing when Emma learns that the resort where she used to spend Christmases with her family is being redeveloped.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/45aEUufsZm7YyBD3lBIpCYDNKJh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/23g8MdtXbNoZ10mxHZUTIh6OS5K.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"voteCount\":17,\"year\":2021,\"runtime\":85,\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Marla Sokoloff\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":80109,\"name\":\"Marla Sokoloff\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9al9Fhb4cNRIx3YSp2DlzWpWfi3.jpg\"},{\"id\":53929,\"name\":\"Haylie Duff\",\"character\":\"Emma\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ziRSxD0fugVY7Sy1Gx29HvkAKPZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1541777,\"name\":\"Aaron O'Connell\",\"character\":\"Liam\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/quD4wRw5kXmqsAxZM854928NS2z.jpg\"},{\"id\":136228,\"name\":\"Christopher Knight\",\"character\":\"Brian\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yqpz1L7FENUb0AMi3ahHoIZg84q.jpg\"},{\"id\":75345,\"name\":\"Mike Lookinland\",\"character\":\"Andrew\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/FzPElVYiLGFOXfSnIZLxDudVrE.jpg\"},{\"id\":1212442,\"name\":\"Susan Olsen\",\"character\":\"Valerie\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/55T9NTWLi6pPMt2FYVL238abNHR.jpg\"},{\"id\":1212425,\"name\":\"Barry Williams\",\"character\":\"John\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/soFevSm00pj1L96mf9ODbSh4veZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":45391,\"name\":\"Beth Broderick\",\"character\":\"Michelle\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aXgETSCjZlvlzdhAiOjhepMdxqR.jpg\"},{\"id\":70004,\"name\":\"Greg Evigan\",\"character\":\"William\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3ZldhsU7EkUJrpBVXmoykDzCbq3.jpg\"},{\"id\":44793,\"name\":\"Telma Hopkins\",\"character\":\"Nicole\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9uxf7rULOwEcIDV9JLFpy44L1hB.jpg\"},{\"id\":112052,\"name\":\"Jennifer Elise Cox\",\"character\":\"Tina\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uc0WaHrCVS1pOfQj7vXmZxHGO4W.jpg\"},{\"id\":77157,\"name\":\"Robbie Rist\",\"character\":\"Sheldon\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xaDQBCyjEOtgsto7xTiVRP0PsKe.jpg\"},{\"id\":1567520,\"name\":\"Emily Alabi\",\"character\":\"Kat\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/plr3lEJmPD3R3zlC1lEwjKNigFy.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":79113,\"title\":\"A Princess for Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qv7fx4gW2bNU3eUiwtaxh829Imq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ocyOdgL8pGS5KRpRfS69SsS2GMa.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After her sister and brother-in-law's tragic deaths, an American woman who is the guardian for her young niece and nephew is invited to a royal European castle for Christmas by her late brother-in-law's father, the Duke of Castlebury. Feeling out of place as a commoner, she is determined to give her family a merry Christmas and surprises herself when she falls for a handsome prince.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":81440,\"title\":\"Good Luck Charlie, It's Christmas!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ecuJMYZM3HQ96mnWtmyXoHb7s7T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3SXATaC4JZA8qxLyAUFjcq17BBV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Teddy Duncan's middle-class family embarks on a road trip from their home in Denver to visit Mrs. Duncans Parents, the Blankenhoopers, in Palm Springs. When they find themselves stranded between Denver and Utah, they try to hitch a ride to Las Vegas with a seemingly normal older couple in a station wagon from Roswell, New Mexico. It turns out that the couple believes they are the victims of alien abduction. The Duncan's must resort to purchasing a clunker Yugo to get to Utah, have their luggage stolen in Las Vegas, and survive a zany Christmas with Grandpa and Grandma Blankenhooper.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":762879,\"title\":\"Christmas...Again?!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tCE4EHfSfGJHKSBIvbSCtplElLE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mFDUO48v1Cik3MToFgBsF2Milvv.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Rowena \\\"Ro\\\" is a high-spirited 11-year-old hoping to add more spunk to her Christmas celebrations when her parents’ divorce is going anything but smoothly.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":145312,\"title\":\"Dear Santa\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1UDzXg6R7K26aBjMpxk9WbQTrpm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mAbDuA5s5fTkc8JltJGWYFkj6ml.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Crystal, a rich party girl, finds a little girl's letter to Santa asking for a new mother, and she vows to win over the father and daughter before the holidays.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1048771,\"title\":\"Christmas Carole\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ffAnG1WGjeImcq7N6dN0PsErjq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tA5gJmhIl7slq3rFtQjZtamL9HE.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Carole Mackay is an unashamedly outspoken and wealthy entrepreneur. Her online business selling all things festive has earned her a fortune, as well as the nickname 'Christmas Carole'. But her success hasn't made her a better human being. In fact, it's made her worse. The truth is that Carole is a monumentally mean person. Positively Scrooge-like. And, just like Ebeneezer, she doesn't love Christmas at all. But this Christmas Eve, Carole's past, present and future are about to collide. Will some rather familiar Christmas spirits help her discover the true spirit of Christmas?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1048788,\"title\":\"The Holiday Swap\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xCtjFiY5DtzLW2OxoxygeJSIpGh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sKStwIb9G0yoQVfMlR04ZKKLtOS.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When two strangers mistakenly pick up the wrong piece of luggage at the airport, each must use the intriguing contents within to track down the other's whereabouts in time for Christmas.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5375,\"title\":\"Fred Claus\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9gATbvoRMxVeoHInwS8nR0KZMVc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nf9Y9KtrSFqUz3gNbsrgmFJV1S4.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fred Claus and Santa Claus have been estranged brothers for many years. Now Fred must reconcile his differences with his brother whom he believes overshadows him. When an efficiency expert assesses the workings at the North Pole and threatens to shut Santa down, Fred must help his brother to save Christmas.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9969,\"title\":\"Deck the Halls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/smJDzhYGhl6j9OrucsB7IkMNy82.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lVSj3d2dvTaK3qO9K2aD1W4L7R0.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Determined to unseat Steve Finch's reign as the town's holiday season king, Buddy Hall plasters his house with so many decorative lights that it'll be visible from space! When their wives bond, and their kids follow suit, the two men only escalate their rivalry - and their decorating.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":847463,\"title\":\"A Chance for Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rChX9Fhqk8RuHK73sylP3PnOML.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bIwkSnlHFqcYPCMGk86uhx6yywx.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Social media influencer Christina Chance promotes the perfect family image. This year, she has the chance to become the face of lifestyle brand, Love Handles, on the condition that her Christmas Eve special delivers at least two million engagements. Seems easy enough except Christina’s family is far from perfect. When her Love Handles account manager, Devon, shows up and discovers Christina’s life is all smoke and mirrors, he helps Christina keep up her ruse. With a Christmas wish, Christina and Devon are given the chance to relive the day until Christina can get the views she needs to win the endorsement. As Christina and Devon work together, sparks fly, and they learn the power of family is far more important than views.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":650890,\"title\":\"Carole's Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lxDLkn6DrzYjQTh6Nw0F6Wvqyb7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kxx9BfR458hflxsmpDuIo1YizE4.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An overworked businesswoman learns the meaning of \\\"be careful what you wish for\\\" after she off-handedly wishes she had taken another path in life.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1630699,\"title\":\"The Great Nickmas Tree Sliming\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9jvyftbzU5ICdLoy7X2dy1TufTZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ilq1RQmb0Iiyw7OVF6Wr4zyDmHh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lay Lay zaps Santa's sleigh, but it is up to her best friends to bring back Christmas.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"nHGSJMFRyKk\",\"name\":\"Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}